  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "カラオケ",
    "id": "2018",
    "timezone": "2"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「これが『からおけ』の店内——何だかちょっと神秘的な感じだね。胎内巡りみたい。暗くて狭くて、落ちつく……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「というか、よく知らないのだけど。『からおけ』というのはふつう、こんなふうに密着して座るものなのかな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「え？　『カップル席』？　という種類なんだ、ふぅん——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「男のひととこんなに近くにいたことないから、何だか変な感じだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「あ。店員さん、ありがとうございます。いつもお勤めご苦労さまです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「わたしのはお茶だけど、君のそれは何？　何だか変な色してるけど——ん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「じゃあ一口だけ。ふぅん、甘いんだ。何の味だろ、これ。ちょっと蜂蜜っぽい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「えっと、どうすればいいのかな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「この機械で、歌いたい曲を——ふん、ふん。でも、知らない曲ばかりだな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「合唱コンクールで歌う曲は……。この画面を触って、これで選んで、……うひゃ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「な、何？　えっ、もう曲が始まったの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「すごいおおきな音だね——えっと、これがマイク？　あれ、音がでないよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「あはは、慌てすぎかな。そうだね——君はわたしがどれだけ不格好でも、怒ったりしなさそうな気がするよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「えぇっと、あ〜♪　あ〜♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「よし、じゃあ歌うね。マイクがあれば、ちいさな声しかだせないわたしも、ちゃんと歌えるね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「『からおけ』、いいね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「君も歌いたい曲があったら、好きなだけ歌ってね。君の歌、聞きたいな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「〜♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「ぷはっ、息継ぎが難しいっ。あ、そっか。ぜんぶのパートを歌わなくてもいいんだよね、自分のパートだけ——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「えぇっと、ああっ、歌詞がどんどん流れてく……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「あ、あれ？　終わった？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「あぁ、けっきょくほとんど歌えなかった——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「でも、何となくコツを掴んだ気がする。もっかい、やっていい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「ありがとう。じゃあ、聞いてね。変なところがあったら、言って。がんばるから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「〜♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「——ふうっ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「今度はちゃんと歌えたかな——あんまり、声がでなかったけど。あれ、点数？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「そんなのも表示されるんだ……。三十五点。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「これは良いの？　悪いの？　あんまり良くない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「そっか、悔しいな——もっかい歌っていい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「ごめん、マイク独占しちゃって。でも、何だか楽しいな——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「世の中には、わたしの知らない面白いものが、いっぱいあるんだよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「また、よかったら——いろいろ、教えてね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「あ、歌が始まっちゃう。えぇっと、あっ、マイクの電源ＯＦＦにしちゃった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「うわっとと、お茶！　お茶がこぼれた！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「あ痛っ、頭ぶつけた！　やっぱり君との距離が近すぎるよ！」"
